pan begin="00:32.940" end="00:33.300">Made </span><span begin="00:33.300" end="00:33.450">up </span><span begin="00:33.450" end="00:33.630">your </span><span begin="00:33.630" end="00:34.620">mind </span><span begin="00:34.620" end="00:34.800">and </span><span begin="00:34.800" end="00:35.040">now </span><span begin="00:35.040" end="00:35.220">you're </span><span begin="00:35.220" end="00:36.150">blind</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.210" end="00:39.240"><span begin="00:36.210" end="00:36.420">I </span><span begin="00:36.420" end="00:36.720">guess </span><span begin="00:36.720" end="00:36.930">it's </span><span begin="00:36.930" end="00:37.470">easier </span><span begin="00:37.470" end="00:37.650">than </span><span begin="00:37.650" end="00:38.070">making </span><span begin="00:38.070" end="00:39.240">mistakes</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.390" end="00:42.660"><span begin="00:39.390" end="00:39.750">Don't </span><span begin="00:39.750" end="00:39.990">ask </span><span begin="00:39.990" end="00:40.110">me </span><span begin="00:40.110" end="00:40.350">why </span><span begin="00:40.350" end="00:40.530">then </span><span begin="00:40.530" end="00:40.740">roll </span><span begin="00:40.740" end="00:40.950">your </span><span begin="00:40.950" end="00:41.250">eyes </span><span begin="00:41.250" end="00:41.370">at </span><span begin="00:41.370" end="00:41.610">the </span><span begin="00:41.610" end="00:42.660">answer</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.690" end="00:45.900"><span begin="00:42.690" end="00:42.960">You </span><span begin="00:42.960" end="00:43.230">want </span><span begin="00:43.230" end="00:43.290">a </span><span begin="00:43.290" end="00:43.620">fight</span><span begin="00:43.620" end="00:43.620">, </span><span begin="00:43.620" end="00:43.860">but </span><span begin="00:43.860" end="00:43.980">I </span><span begin="00:43.980" end="00:44.160">won't </span><span begin="00:44.160" end="00:44.490">bite </span><span begin="00:44.490" en